{
  "id": "Lyo.Authentication.Web.Components.Server",
  "name": "Lyo.Authentication.Web.Components.Server",
  "area": "Security",
  "tagline": "Blazor Server host adapter for `Lyo.Authentication.Web.Components`. Plugs the shared login / debug / profile pages into the BFF-cookie auth runtime in `Lyo.Authentication.Client`.",
  "description": "Blazor Server host adapter for [`Lyo.Authentication.Web.Components`](../Lyo.Authentication.Web.Components/README.md). Plugs the shared login / debug / profile pages into the\nBFF-cookie auth runtime in [`Lyo.Authentication.Client`](../Lyo.Authentication.Client/README.md).",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Register services",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "builder.Services.AddLyoAuthClient(builder.Configuration);\nbuilder.Services.AddLyoAuthBlazorStateProvider();\nbuilder.Services.AddLyoAuthWebComponents(builder.Configuration);\nbuilder.Services.AddLyoAuthWebComponentsServer();\n\nvar app = builder.Build();\napp.UseAuthentication();\napp.UseAuthorization();\napp.MapLyoAuthSignIn();\napp.MapLyoAuthHandoffCallback();\napp.MapLyoAuthSignOut();"
    },
    {
      "title": "Register services (2)",
      "language": "razor",
      "code": "<Router AppAssembly=\"typeof(Program).Assembly\"\n        AdditionalAssemblies=\"new[] { typeof(Lyo.Authentication.Web.Components.Pages.LoginPage).Assembly }\">"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "What's inside",
      "headers": [
        "Service",
        "Role"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`ServerAuthSignInLauncher`",
          "Sign-in 302s through the consumer's `/auth/sign-in/{provider}` endpoint; sign-out submits a POST to `/auth/sign-out` via a dynamically constructed form (CSRF-safe)."
        ],
        [
          "`ServerAuthSessionAccessor`",
          "Unseals the HttpOnly session cookie via `IDataProtectionProvider`, reads the active `LyoAuthSession` from `LyoAuthSessionStore`, and rotates it through `/auth/refresh` for the debug page's \"Refresh token\" button."
        ],
        [
          "`ServerAuthUserClient`",
          "Typed `HttpClient` with `AddLyoAuthHandler()` so calls to `GET /auth/me` and `GET /auth/users/{id}` automatically carry the bearer and auto-refresh on 401."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Registration",
      "text": "Make sure the consuming Blazor Server router picks up this package's pages — either via auto-scan or by adding the assembly to `AdditionalAssemblies`:"
    }
  ],
